@nsobid-1F1C44F29E77B5D6C7AA5A518E724318

# Splatoon 2 March 24 2017 prototype - Level of Detail

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Forces the texture sampler mip-LOD bias to -1.0 for sharper textures.
// Patches nn::gfx::detail::SamplerImpl::Initialize: the LDR S0,[X20,#0x10]
// that loads SamplerInfo.lodBias just before nvnSamplerBuilderSetLodBias,
// replaced with FMOV S0, #-1.0.

@enabled
0168EF14 00103E1E
@stop

// Resolution/LOD technique derived from Fl4sh9174's retail Splatoon 2 5.5.x mods.
// Dev-build offsets reverse-engineered against the Cstm/Lp engine
// (Lp::Sys::ISysInitCstm::getScanBufferSize / nn::gfx SamplerImpl::Initialize).
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-patches
